# Engineering Values

PowerChain engineering is guided by the following values:

* Simplicity over unnecessary complexity
* Security before convenience
* Explicit behaviour over implicit assumptions
* Open standards over proprietary solutions
* Automation over manual processes
* Documentation as a core deliverable
* Continuous improvement through transparent governance

These values provide consistency across software development, protocol governance and ecosystem collaboration.

